                %em On the comparison of topologies
                1956, Journal of the London Mathematical Society, vol. s1-32 no. 3, pp. 342-354,
            %li
              %p
                J. C. Kelly,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Bitopological spaces
                %strong 13
                no.3 (1963) pp. 71-89.
          %p Only Kelly introduced the concept in its nowadays formulation of a set equipped with two topologies. The Russian school contributed the following comprehensive overviews of this and related topics
          %ul
